flowchart LR
  Staff[Operador Angular] --> CDN[CloudFront]
  CDN --> SSR[Lambda Angular SSR]
  CDN --> Assets[S3 privado de assets]
  CDN --> API[HTTP API JWT]
  Staff -->|Registro y acceso PKCE| Cognito[Cognito]
  Cognito -->|PostConfirmation| Confirm[Lambda de confirmación]
  Cognito -->|PreTokenGeneration V1| Token[Lambda de claims]
  Confirm --> IdentityDB[DynamoDB Identidad]
  Token --> IdentityDB
  Cognito -->|ID token de la membresía| Staff
  API --> Events[Lambda Eventos]
  API --> Reconciliation[Lambda Conciliación]
  Events --> EventDB[DynamoDB Eventos]
  Reconciliation --> LedgerDB[DynamoDB Conciliación]
  Reconciliation -->|contrato interno IAM| Events
  Staff -->|URL PUT temporal| Uploads[S3 privado CSV]
  Uploads --> Queue[SQS]
  Queue --> Worker[Lambda Importador]
  Queue --> DLQ[DLQ]
  Worker --> LedgerDB
  Worker -->|contrato interno IAM| Events
